    Collections Comparison:

        Lists:
            ArrayList            - storing sequences; backed by array
            LinkedList           - storing sequences; backed by linked nodes
            CopyOnWriteArrayList - storing sequences + thread safety; use when reads > writes

        Maps:
            HashMap           - storing k/v pairs
            LinkedHashMap     - storing k/v pairs with preserved insertion order
            TreeMap           - storing k/v pairs sorted by key
            ConcurrentHashMap - storing k/v pairs + thread safety

        Sets:
            HashSet       - storing unique values
            LinkedHashSet - storing unique values with preserved insertion order
            TreeSet       - storing unique values in sorted order

        Queues:
            BlockingQueue           - interface; FIFO; producer-consumer; blocking
                ArrayBlockingQueue  - BlockingQueue backed by an array
                LinkedBlockingQueue - BlockingQueue backed by linked nodes
            ConcurrentLinkedQueue   - FIFO; producer-consumer; non-blocking

